# open-test

AI-TEST-AI is an agentic testing platform where the real intelligence lives in the agent layer.

## Services

- API: Go gateway
- Agent: Python LangGraph orchestrator
- Executor: Go Playwright runner
- Frontend: React dashboard/report UI

## Defaults

```env
POSTGRES_DB=wharttest
POSTGRES_USER=admin
POSTGRES_PASSWORD=password
REDIS_URL=redis://redis:6379
DATABASE_URL=postgres://admin:password@postgres:5432/wharttest
NEO4J_URI=bolt://neo4j:7687
NEO4J_USER=neo4j
NEO4J_PASSWORD=password
ELASTICSEARCH_URL=http://elasticsearch:9200
OPENAI_API_KEY=your_key_here
```
